WEBVTT

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:10.210
Fixed Reverse calculation complete.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.660
Existence rate rising.

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:13.390
High density REIZU convergence!

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:16.120
She's here.

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:22.390
Ow...

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:28.070
Dragon Torque, I have
waited a long time for you!

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:34.010
What?!

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:38.100
Karasu?!

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:44.230
Yuu!

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:44.250
You dare interfere with me again!
Yuu!

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:46.270
You dare interfere with me again!

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:48.760
Haruka!

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.760
Yuu!

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:54.280
Let go of him!

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:58.990
Yuu!

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:13.880
Haruka.

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:15.850
Yuu...

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:20.030
Where are we?

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:22.520
It's like an underground city.

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:23.550
Underground?

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:27.000
Yeah. They said that this is La'cryma.

00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:28.590
La'cryma?

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:31.110
It's supposed to be
15 years into the future.

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:34.300
The future?

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:15.940
Haruka?! Goto?!

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:20.970
Atori? Are you okay, Atori?!

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:23.420
They disappeared.

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:24.970
I... Impossible.

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:28.020
It's La'cryma.
They both went to La'cryma.

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:29.980
Why couldn't you prevent it?!

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:31.680
I'm sorry.

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:33.520
Send me to La'cryma this instant!

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.360
That's impossible, Karasu!

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:38.390
I don't have enough equipment to
construct a transportation system.

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:39.960
Knock it off.

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:43.160
This is no time for a dispute!

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:44.690
Atori...

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:47.040
Is your memory back?

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:49.790
Tobi, think!

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:51.340
Atori...

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:56.750
You can do it, can't you?
You can bring back those brats.

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:59.650
Looks like everything's okay.

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:02.450
Yes, but I felt a powerful
dimensional bend.

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:05.620
You saw that light, didn't you?

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:06.890
Sort of.

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:08.690
Something has happened.

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:15.400
Uchida-san! What perfect timing.

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:17.650
I was just about to go look for you.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:18.730
Huh?

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:22.800
You own a quantum computer, right?

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:26.570
That machine is only a prototype.
Will it be okay?

00:04:26.610 --> 00:04:28.740
It's better than the Neumann model!

00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:36.220
What is this place? Why are
they living underground like this?

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:38.710
I don't think they can live on the surface.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:42.490
How come? What happened in the future?

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:44.520
I'm not really sure...

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:47.690
but something terrible happened.

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:50.500
They're being attacked
by these weird things.

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:53.770
That's why they all moved underground.

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:56.170
Your explanation doesn't
make any sense whatsoever.

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:03.080
But you know... who would've imagined
that this would be our future.

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:06.620
I was also told that
this isn't the only future.

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:07.520
Huh?

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:10.950
They said we don't have
just one future but many.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:10.960
What're you talking about?
The future is the future, isn't it?
They said we don't have
just one future but many.

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:14.160
What're you talking about?
The future is the future, isn't it?

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:16.560
It's difficult to explain...

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:20.160
but there are countless dimension
which exist in every second of our time.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.330
So that's why this is
one of many possible futures.

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:27.340
One possible future?

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:29.400
That's what Ai told me.

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:31.770
Ai? Why would she tell you that?

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.140
It's the Ai of this world.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:34.650
This world?

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:37.050
Hey! You're here again!

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:38.730
And this time you've got a man with you!

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:40.150
Lily!

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:41.730
It's a mini Miho.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:45.450
I'm Lily! Miho is my mom's name!

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:48.490
But you really are stupid, you know?

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:52.700
Haruka, don't you know that the
dragon soldiers are out looking for you?

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:56.960
I know that, but I was brought here, so I...

00:05:56.960 --> 00:06:00.530
Jeez! You sound like it's no big deal!

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:03.090
Ugh! You'll be caught
again at this rate!

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:05.800
Aw, they'll put me in a fish tank again!

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:08.510
I know! Let's go to Auntie's place!

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:10.580
Auntie?

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:13.880
Haruka?! What are you doing here?

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:15.310
What happened?!

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:16.990
I'm not so sure...

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:19.460
You know what? I cant believe this!

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:20.980
Yuu?

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:22.960
You're Yuu, aren't you?

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:24.280
Y... Yes.

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:28.260
It's been ages. You're still
12 years old, aren't you?

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:29.970
Yes...

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:33.170
Is this really Ai? Don't you
think she's a little too nice?

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:35.540
Now come inside.

00:06:36.010 --> 00:06:37.740
You don't want to be spotted
by the dragon soldiers.

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:38.840
Y-Yeah.

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:40.540
Hurry! Hurry!

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:47.110
Wow, this is kind of amazing!

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:48.810
Will this really work?

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:50.350
They can hear you!

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:52.580
Karasu, can you stand right below it?

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:56.960
Is this good?

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.620
Now stay still for a while...

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:00.520
I'm all set!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.870
Do you think this contraption will work?

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:04.480
Activate!

00:07:12.810 --> 00:07:13.900
Is it working?

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:22.810
It's no good.

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:24.560
What's wrong?

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:25.750
We don't have enough power.

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:26.590
What?

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:27.890
What?! You're kidding!

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:29.490
It's a failure?

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:35.360
Kosagi?

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:38.070
Use this.

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:41.040
A storage battery!

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:44.570
Where did you get this?

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:47.230
Kuina gave it to me.

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:49.210
Kosagi...

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:51.950
But it's not necessary for me.

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:54.710
Make sure to bring
them both back, Karasu.

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:04.960
They performed a fixed
reverse calculation on you then.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.490
I think Tobi said something
along those lines.

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:09.830
More confusing dialogue?

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:13.730
At any rate, we need to come up
with a plan to send you back.

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:15.890
Where is Karasu?

00:08:16.310 --> 00:08:18.830
I'm Haruka's protector right now.

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:20.640
He and I have a deal.

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:23.140
I see.

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:25.880
Keep her safe, Yuu.

00:08:26.090 --> 00:08:27.650
Right.

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:29.640
Yuu...

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:31.350
But...

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:35.120
We have to go to that room
to get back, right?

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.360
The room we arrived in?

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:38.130
That's the transporter room.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:40.000
Then we should do it quick, so...

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:46.300
I brought food.

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:49.920
- Yuu?!
- What's wrong?

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:52.970
I... I'm okay.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:55.140
- Yuu!
- Let him lay down!

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:57.810
What is this? I...

00:08:58.120 --> 00:08:59.550
I feel so weak...

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:01.990
Yuu! Hang on, Yuu!

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:05.120
Look at his body!

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:06.590
No way...

00:09:07.390 --> 00:09:08.860
Haruka, go outside!

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:10.150
Now!

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:12.760
Why?! I want to stay here!

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:13.700
Yuu!

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:15.630
You must not see it!

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:20.060
He's... not even breathing...

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:21.900
Yuu!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.040
What is this?

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:26.480
A minute point is infiltrating
the dimension of La'cryma!

00:09:26.810 --> 00:09:28.440
My god...

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:31.480
It's the bird! The bird has returned!

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:40.640
Haruka.

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:44.560
How come?! Why won't you let me inside?!

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:48.330
Come on, calm down and listen to me.

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:51.460
Yuu... Yuu will die!

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:52.900
Haruka!

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:59.700
Haruka, you're a strong girl, aren't you?

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:06.690
Ai...

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:09.450
Haruka, listen.

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:12.460
In our world, where the quantum
revolution has occurred,

00:10:12.490 --> 00:10:16.290
all things lapsed into a quantum state.

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:21.180
A world where the existence of
all dimensions can't be established...

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:23.530
including humanity itself.

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:27.800
We are an unstable existence
without an observer.

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:30.690
Observer?

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:33.510
So, we stabilized this world...

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:37.640
by transforming everything
into descriptive REIZU data...

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:40.410
which was stored
inside a quantum computer.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:43.550
And we named this world La'cryma.

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:48.760
In other words, things without
a data description can't exist here.

00:10:49.730 --> 00:10:51.380
That's why Yuu is...

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:53.900
But I'm right here!

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:55.870
You're a special case.

00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:59.090
And you were recorded in
the memory the last time you came.

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:04.070
That can't be.

00:11:04.110 --> 00:11:07.410
Now listen carefully.
This is the crucial part.

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:11.580
I know it appears as though Yuu is dead.

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:15.610
But as long as his existence
remains unstable...

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:19.320
his death here is also ambiguous.

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:22.240
I don't understand what you're saying.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:26.190
Simply put, Yuu is currently
in an overlapping state...

00:11:26.230 --> 00:11:29.860
of "dimensions where he is dead"
and "dimensions where he is alive."

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:34.270
Dead Yuu... And living Yuu?

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:35.800
Yes.

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:38.130
Is there also a living Yuu?!

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:41.370
Yes. That is why you
must not look at him.

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:43.670
You, the Dragon Torque...

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:46.890
may very well have the power
to finalize whatever you observe.

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:53.050
If you witness Yuu in
a state of death now...

00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:55.270
his death will become reality.

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:58.590
That can't be...

00:11:59.430 --> 00:12:03.870
However, if you can
witness Yuu in a living state...

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:07.460
and recognize each other's existences...

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:12.080
he will be established
in a living state, I'm sure.

00:12:12.550 --> 00:12:15.450
Okay, so where is the living Yuu?!

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:17.510
Well...

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:19.210
He's in Shangri-la.

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:34.260
Haruka...

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:40.370
What is this?

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:44.610
Where is this?

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:47.570
This isn't Heaven, is it?

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:52.210
It's you.

00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:57.680
I never thought you
would come to this land.

00:12:58.760 --> 00:13:03.320
That means even I wasn't able to
fully predict the will of the dimension.

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:36.790
Yuu is in Shangri-la?!

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:37.960
Haruka!

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.860
Do you want to save him?

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:42.800
Then come with me to Shangri-la!

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:45.200
Shangri-la?

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:48.000
Kuina! Have you betrayed La'cryma?!

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:53.040
You have no right to speak after assisting
Dragon Torque's escape. Now move!

00:13:54.010 --> 00:13:57.510
Or are you going to help Karasu,
the guy who killed Fukuro?

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:59.770
You're wrong! It wasn't Karasu!

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:03.820
Believe me, Ai. It wasn't Karasu.

00:14:04.390 --> 00:14:06.980
Isami and Yuu were friends
to the very end.

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:10.190
And he said he missed you.

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:12.490
Isami said that?

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:15.460
It wasn't Karasu, it was Noein.

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:19.760
That's why I hate Shangri-la.
I despise it!

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:23.210
But...

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:26.980
Karasu!

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.780
Kuina, I wont' let you have her.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:31.710
Why, you!

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:38.310
Don't, Karasu! I have to go
to Shangri-la to save Yuu.

00:14:39.630 --> 00:14:42.270
I have to go, or Yuu will die!

00:14:42.530 --> 00:14:43.740
He will?!

00:14:47.730 --> 00:14:48.700
What?!

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:50.000
Auntie!

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:50.990
Lily!

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:02.880
It's a monster!

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:10.280
La'cryma is about to disappear.
It was just another weak dimension.

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:15.390
Shangri-la isn't the only cause
for the dimensional assimilation.

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:17.590
This is fate!

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:20.720
Those deemed unnecessary
are destined to disappear.

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:24.230
Karasu, you agree with me, don't you?

00:15:24.640 --> 00:15:26.570
Born in this dimension...

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:29.510
have you ever once felt
the satisfaction of existence?

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:31.840
Nothing but all pain and suffering.

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:34.440
Don't you know that this dimension...

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:37.380
is meant only to bring
misery for those who exist.

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:42.590
And that is why only
Shangri-la can save me!

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:47.920
As long as I have the Torque,
I will be accepted into Shangri-la!

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:52.690
To a dimension filled with happiness
and where there's no suffering!

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:55.570
Where there is no need for suffering!

00:15:58.170 --> 00:15:59.400
Where am I?

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:01.600
This place is Shangri-la.

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:05.980
The blissful future that
the people wished for.

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:09.770
That the people wished for?
Where is everyone?

00:16:10.520 --> 00:16:12.510
They have no form.

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:16.910
This is a world where
only consciousness exists.

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:17.910
Consciousness?

00:16:26.070 --> 00:16:27.400
Haruka!

00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:35.900
Don't, Karasu!

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:39.560
If I don't go, Yuu will die.

00:16:40.780 --> 00:16:43.340
I promise I will save him.

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:46.210
Noein! Accept me into Shangri-la!

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:47.690
Haruka...

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:53.520
Haruka!

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:17.940
He's the one who helped me and Isami.

00:17:18.820 --> 00:17:22.380
Yes you are right. You've met him once.

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:26.510
This is what Isami Fujiwara
looks like in 15 years.

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:27.770
That's him?!

00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:31.050
But you know, that Isami was murdered.

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:33.990
Who do you think is the culprit?

00:17:34.470 --> 00:17:36.660
You. You're the one who killed him.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:40.000
You'll be killing him
15 years into the future.

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:43.000
15 years into the future?
You mean Karasu?!

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:46.000
No... absolutely not.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:46.010
It's me. Because I am you.
No... absolutely not.

00:17:46.010 --> 00:17:49.340
It's me. Because I am you.

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:52.980
In your future,
you will kill your best friend.

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:56.150
You're lying.

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:58.720
That's a lie!

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:13.060
Aagh! We have arrived in Shangri-la!

00:18:13.970 --> 00:18:15.840
The eternal Shangri-la!

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:17.830
This is it?

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:20.240
But why?

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:24.410
This dimension!
Shangri-la is rejecting me!

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:36.090
Karasu?!

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:37.930
You followed us all the way here?

00:18:39.270 --> 00:18:41.700
You are definitely the man
I made you out to be.

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:45.230
I knew you would make
a good dragon soldier.

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:48.100
So, my judgment was solid after all.

00:18:49.110 --> 00:18:51.300
And now look at me.

00:18:51.340 --> 00:18:53.900
This is what I get for wishing for Shangri-la.

00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:58.880
Laugh, Karasu!
Laugh at what a fool I am!

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:09.050
He's falling apart.

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:16.090
Yuu!

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:18.300
Yuu is calling out to me!

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:22.400
He's over there!

00:19:22.710 --> 00:19:24.440
Hold on tight!

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:49.870
GO!

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:09.580
You will live with infinite unhappiness.

00:20:11.090 --> 00:20:14.860
Now, and forever. Until you die.

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:20.230
That is your dimension.

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:23.860
Yuu! Karasu, hurry!

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:38.130
Yuu!

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:39.630
Haruka!

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:44.890
Damn it!

00:20:53.030 --> 00:20:54.310
Yuu!

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:55.800
Damn!

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:57.560
Get out of my way.

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:07.030
Yuu!

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:14.960
Yuu!

00:21:39.180 --> 00:21:40.580
Yuu...

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:45.480
Hang in there, Yuu! Please wake up!

00:21:47.450 --> 00:21:48.980
What?!

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:53.760
No, Yuu...

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:56.020
Karasu... Where are you?

00:21:56.630 --> 00:21:58.760
Karasu... Yuu...

00:21:58.800 --> 00:22:00.730
Yuu will disappear!

00:22:03.140 --> 00:22:07.160
Yuu! Please don't go...

00:22:08.170 --> 00:22:09.900
Don't disappear...

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:14.480
Yuu!

00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:19.550
He's disappearing.

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:23.420
Haruka... Tell me you found him?

00:22:39.200 --> 00:22:40.900
Haruka...

00:22:42.910 --> 00:22:43.840
Yuu.

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:47.110
Give a guy a little
breathing room, would you?

00:22:47.150 --> 00:22:48.770
Yuu...

00:22:49.180 --> 00:22:50.480
Thank God!

00:22:50.520 --> 00:22:51.740
Hey!

00:22:51.780 --> 00:22:53.120
I'm so glad...

00:22:53.150 --> 00:22:55.180
Cut it out, Haruka...

00:22:55.750 --> 00:22:57.350
I'm so glad...

00:22:57.390 --> 00:22:59.820
C'mon, let me go already.

00:24:42.230 --> 00:24:44.200
I'm dreaming again.

00:24:45.230 --> 00:24:47.100
That summer day's dream.

00:24:47.540 --> 00:24:51.430
Shangri-la is unstable. There is
a risk that Haruka will disappear.

00:24:54.740 --> 00:24:57.370
Let's get movin' here shall we?

00:24:59.390 --> 00:25:02.240
You have made the correct choice.

00:25:04.080 --> 00:25:06.640
Next episode, Illusion.

00:25:07.890 --> 00:25:10.400
Will you be able to find it?
